@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Upload a PDF (adjust the path of the file)
POST {{host}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="rechnung.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents
GET {{host}}/api/documents

### Download (replace the id with one from the list)
GET {{host}}/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/content
